OL,3,GNEWSA'We're held to ransom by our
OL,4,Ahousing estate's management fees'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA group of homeowners have challenged a
OL,7,F"fleecehold" system which has seen them
OL,8,Fpay rising fees for the management of
OL,9,Ftheir housing development.
OL,11,FResidents of The Potteries in West
OL,12,FYorkshire say they are being "held to
OL,13,Fransom" by Blue Property Management UK,
OL,14,Fwhich charges them #209 per year for
OL,15,Fground maintenance as well as
OL,16,Fadditional costs.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,390,380,200,160,0,100
