OL,3,GNEWSA'We're held to ransom by our
OL,4,Ahousing estate's management fees'
OL,5,
OL,6,FSome householders have incurred charges
OL,7,Ffor having changes made to their
OL,8,Fproperty deeds and one man was fined
OL,9,Fafter a payment request was delivered
OL,10,Fto his home after a deadline had
OL,11,Fpassed.
OL,13,FThe action group's members - from 80
OL,14,Fhouseholds - say that communal areas
OL,15,Fare not maintained despite the levy,
OL,16,Fwith weeds and dead vegetation left
OL,17,Funcleared.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
